#==============================================================================================
#
#   flex_formatting_context_3 - Layout::FlexFormattingContext: flex base sizes, automatic
#                               minimum sizes, flex lines and flexible lengths
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/FlexFormattingContext.cpp (lines 655-1192): the flex base size
#       and hypothetical main size of an item (steps A-E of
#       https://drafts.csswg.org/css-flexbox-1/#algo-main-item), the automatic minimum size and
#       its specified, content and transferred size suggestions, collecting items into flex
#       lines, and resolving the flexible lengths of each line (freezing inflexible items,
#       distributing free space by flex factors, fixing min/max violations).
#
#       Copyright (c) 2021-2025, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2021, Tobias Christiansen <tobyase@serenityos.org>
